---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Technology News & Cloud Industry Updates | Digikhojindia"
  description="Stay ahead with technology news covering cloud computing, healthcare software, automation, and cybersecurity."
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400">Industry Dispatch</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mt-2 sm:text-5xl">
        Technology News & Industry Insights
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
        Curated analysis of technological breakthroughs, digital health standards, and business automation trends.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-400 uppercase">Healthcare Standards</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2">Ayushman Bharat Digital Mission (ABDM) Milestone 3 Fast-Tracking</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          National health authorities in India have updated integration benchmarks for Hospital Information Management Systems (HMIS) to mandate instant ABHA creation and milestone 3 digital health record linkage. Digikhojindia HMIS incorporates these protocols natively.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-400 uppercase">Cloud Architecture</span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Global Shift Towards Edge SQLite and Serverless D1 Datastores</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Enterprise SaaS platforms are increasingly migrating relational data to edge-replicated SQLite engines such as Cloudflare D1. With sub-millisecond local reads and zero cold-start penalties, transactional business platforms achieve unparalleled speed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
